  "prefLabel": "Ed 603.02 Candidate Advising",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 603.02 Candidate Advising.\n\n(a) The program shall be designed to ensure that a PEPP assesses how candidates are advised and counseled throughout the program.\n\n(b) The program shall include an advisory process that ensures each candidate:\n\n(1) Understands the criteria for successfully meeting the requirements of the licensure program;\n\n(2) Receives support in meeting the required criteria; and\n\n(3) When necessary, is counseled out of educator preparation and advised into exploration of other career options and programs of study.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Ed 603) #6048, eff 6-2-95; ss by #6366, eff 10-30-96; ss by #8194, eff 10-26-04; ss by #10295, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13744, eff 9-15-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed600.html"
